Thunes APIs

1. Quotation

a. Credit a quotation
Creates a new quotation for a given source or destination value.

To Gag: POST https://localhost:8443/thunes/v2/outbound/money-transfer/create-quote
{
	"sender": {
		"amount": "100",
		"currency": "EUR",
        "countryCode": "FRA"
    },
    "receiver": {
		"payerId": "9",
		"currency": "USD"
    },
	"transactionDetails": {
		"transactionType": "C2C"
	},
    "channelInfo": {
        "rrn": "111996657000",
        "bankId": "54",
        "channelId": "OMNI",
        "sourceSystemId": "ONMI"
    },
    "signature": ""
}

To Thunes:
POST: https://api-pre.mm.transferto.com/v2/money-transfer/quotations

{
    "external_id": "111996657000",
    "payer_id": "9",
    "mode": "SOURCE_AMOUNT",
    "transaction_type": "C2C",
